# OpenSIPS dispatcher set file
# Format: <setid> <destination> <flags> <priority> <weight> <attrs>
#
# Set 1: admitted inbound lane — Asterisk only.
#   During the inbound canary a failed Asterisk must produce an explicit SIP
#   failure.  Silently moving a call to another B2BUA would bypass the single
#   admission/lifecycle implementation being proved by the canary.
#
# Set 2: canary lane — Asterisk only.  It may point at a separate Asterisk
#   instance, but never at FreeSWITCH while this canary contract is active.

# setid  destination              flags  priority  weight
1 sip:127.0.0.1:5070 0 0 100   # Asterisk   (primary)
2 sip:127.0.0.1:5070 0 0 100   # Canary: stable mirror (Asterisk)
